<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gentyre, Macphail delisting okayed.</title>
<headline>Gentyre, Macphail delisting okayed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange listings of Gentyre Industries Ltd and MacPhail Holdings Ltd will be terminated on August 1 after shareholders approved their absorption by parent Forward Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>Forward said 97 percent of Gentyre minorities backed the moved and 69 percent of MacPhail's.</p>
<p>&quot;This shows that in spite of criticism expressed in some quarters, the great majority of these two companies' shareholders ultimately saw that restructuring along the lines we proposed was the best -- and in the case of MacPhail -- the only option,&quot; said Forward chief executive Mike Smithyman.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
